The copied CosmicWatermark components originated in the user's Apollo source tree,
commit 4133f30f5a4028bb789b1335f1892e02d9e07be5 (2026-07-18).

Pinned planetary-satellite state vectors were generated from the public NASA/JPL
Horizons API. Data provenance is recorded in src/data/satellite-reference.json.

The stellar catalog asset is derived from the Bright Star Catalogue, Fifth Revised
Edition (Hoffleit and Warren, 1991), catalog V/50, disseminated by the NASA
Astronomical Data Center and CDS VizieR. Provenance and checksums are recorded in
src/data/bright-stars.json.

The compact solar photosphere frame is derived from the NASA Solar Dynamics
Observatory HMI continuum quicklook. Observation time, source URL, processing,
credit, and checksums are recorded in src/data/sun-hmi.json.

The lunar albedo map is derived from the NASA Scientific Visualization Studio
LRO/WAC color mosaic. Provenance and checksums are recorded in
src/data/moon-albedo.json.
